      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "NukeBridge \u2014 all-in-one passes for Nuke\n\nLaunched from Nuke (ComfyUI > Generate passes): the panel fills NUKE_INPUT with the plate frames, sends 25 frames per run (+2 overlap each side) and loads the EXRs back.\n\nEXR layers\n\u2022 N        Sapiens2 on person + head crops, MoGe elsewhere,\n           stabilized: neighbours \u00b12 frames warped with optical\n           flow (RAFT) and averaged where the plate matches\n\u2022 depth.Z  Video Depth Anything metric \u2014 stable, metres\n\u2022 P        rebuilt from depth.Z + MoGe camera (FOV 86\u00b0)\n\u2022 A        matte from LTX-2.5 Alpha Gen (plate fitted to\n           1920 wide, matte resized back to the plate)\n           use_alpha_mask off = Sapiens2 segmentation instead,\n           and the LTX group is skipped (much faster)\n\ncomparison_layers = on \u2192 also Nraw (before stabilization),\nNmoge, depth_moge.Z for A/B."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
